      "value": "@{58d978fe386f402e914c978b|full_name}: Yeah, the VRM format is backed by some pretty serious companies and usage is totally free. It was designed with stuff like VRChat in mind and is incredibly optimized. I'd really like to see them get to implementing it soon. It's a massive win for everyone.",
