      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The developer of dynamic bones is still actively responding. They could contact the developer and push for testing a more performant version of dynamic bones. ie, looking to see if the ECS/Jobs system can benefit dynamic bones.\n\nVRM would be a great system to test out though, and have both systems in the game where the performance metrics would reflect which system should be used without breaking compatibility with existing dynamic bone using avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
