      "value": "@{5ab16fb14c0c3b511e9a4d9b|full_name}: Oh trust me, I’m well aware of this. In an ideal world we could just get on a multithreaded version of Unity and be done with it, but that’s something the devs aren’t willing to do right now.\nReally, getting a replacement for dynamic bones wouldn’t fix the problem, but it’d be a start.",
